      "statement_scope": "Theorem3.8 restricted to finite positive noninteger m (hence noninteger d+m), retaining d>=3, positive f and mu real. Existence and uniqueness are for straight normal weighted ambient jets modulo O(rho^infinity), with curvature equations holding to infinite order. No convergent exact Ricci-flat solution or integer resonance case is claimed.",
